      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, been having this weird heavy/dull feeling in my jaw and neck for like an hour. nothing in my chest or anything so i dont think it's a big deal, probably just stress or clenching my teeth while i work. u think it's just muscle tension or something i can just deal with at home? dont really wanna waste time at a clinic if i dont have to lol",
